  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Revitalization and preservation of resort &#x201c;&#x10c;esma&#x201d; (&#x201c;Fountain&#x201d;)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Revitalization and preservation of resort &#x201c;&#x10c;esma&#x201d; (&#x201c;Fountain&#x201d;)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Projekt je zameran&#xfd; na revitaliz&#xe1;ciu a rekon&#x161;trukciu pr&#xed;rodn&#xe9;ho vodn&#xe9;ho prame&#x148;a a jeho okolia, ktor&#xe9; predstavuje z&#xf3;nu oddychu pre obyvate&#x13e;ov mesta Gra&#x10d;anica. V r&#xe1;mci projektu sa vy&#x10d;ist&#xed; prame&#x148;, vykonaj&#xfa; sa potrebn&#xe9; ter&#xe9;nne pr&#xe1;ce, zemn&#xe9; pr&#xe1;ce, kon&#x161;truk&#x10d;n&#xe9; pr&#xe1;ce, in&#x161;tal&#xe1;cia dreven&#xe9;ho letn&#xe9;ho domu, odpadkov&#xfd;ch ko&#x161;ov, dekorat&#xed;vnych rastl&#xed;n ap., &#x10d;&#xed;m sa vytvor&#xed; priestor pre tr&#xe1;venie vo&#x13e;n&#xe9;ho &#x10d;asu obyvate&#x13e;ov Gra&#x10d;anice.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is focused on the revitalization and reconstruction of a natural spring and its surroundings, which serves as a recreational area for the residents of the city of Gra&#x10d;anica. As part of the project, the spring will be cleaned, necessary fieldwork, earthworks, construction work, installation of a wooden summer house, trash bins, decorative plants, etc., will be carried out, creating a space for the residents of Gra&#x10d;anica to spend their leisure time.</narrative>
  </description>
